            <body>
            <div type="edition" xml:space="preserve">
                <ab xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="I"><lb n="1"/>Δήμητρι καὶ Κόρηι εὐχὴν<lb n="2"/>Ἑλλόοικος Ποτείσιος ἀνέθηκε.</div><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="II"><lb n="1"/>ta-ma-ti-ri | ka-se | ko-ra-i | e-lo-wo-i-ko-se | po-te-si-o-se | a-ne-te-ke | i tu-ka-i | ←</div></ab>
            </div>
            <div type="translation" xml:lang="DE" resp="Klaus Hallof"><ab xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="I"><lb n="1"/>Der Demeter und Kore hat als Gelübde<lb n="2"/>Hellooikos S.d. Poteisis (dies) geweiht.</div><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="II"><lb n="1"/>Der Demeter und Kore hat (dies) Hel(l)owoikos S.d. Potesis geweiht zum Heil.</div></ab></div><div type="translation" xml:lang="GRC" resp=" "><ab xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="I"><lb/><lb/><lb/></div><div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="II"><lb n="1"/>Δάματρι κὰς Κόραι Ἑλ(λ)όϝοικος Ποτήσιος ἀνέθηκε ἰ(ν) τύχαι.</div></ab></div>
            <div type="bibliography">
                <p>Inscriptiones Cypri. Pars I. Inscriptiones Cypri syllabicae. Fasc. 1. Inscriptiones Amathuntis, Curii, Marii. Edid. Artemis Karnava et Massimo Perna adiuvante Markus Egetmeyer. – Berlin 2020</p>
